From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yang Yingliang <yangyingliang@huawei.com>
Date: Sat, 27 Mar 2021 16:37:04 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fs: dlm: fix missing unlock on error in accept_from_sock()

Add the missing unlock before return from accept_from_sock()
in the error handling case.

Fixes: 6cde210a9758 ("fs: dlm: add helper for init connection")
Reported-by: Hulk Robot <hulkci@huawei.com>
Signed-off-by: Yang Yingliang <yangyingliang@huawei.com>
Signed-off-by: David Teigland <teigland@redhat.com>
---
 fs/dlm/lowcomms.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/fs/dlm/lowcomms.c b/fs/dlm/lowcomms.c
index a8994caca153..a90c76796d4b 100644
--- a/fs/dlm/lowcomms.c
+++ b/fs/dlm/lowcomms.c
@@ -933,6 +933,7 @@ static int accept_from_sock(struct listen_connection *con)
 			result = dlm_con_init(othercon, nodeid);
 			if (result < 0) {
 				kfree(othercon);
+				mutex_unlock(&newcon->sock_mutex);
 				goto accept_err;
 			}
 
